 "name_en": "Prediction of Delivery Date for Purchase Order Items (3FY)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Prediction of Delivery Date for Purchase Order Items (3FY)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio392736b885124e309d463bb2263f431f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio392736b885124e309d463bb2263f431f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Materials required for production are supplied by multiple suppliers. A delay in delivery can impact on-time production at the plant and cause rescheduling of assembly lines, which is very costly. Indirect material delay also causes interruption in supporting employees with required products or services. The Machine Learning algorithms identify the supplier delays based on the multiple situation and predicts the chances of delay.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">During creation of purchase orders or purchase requisitions, the lead time from the material master sometimes doesn't consider the processing and approval time.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio392736b885124e309d463bb2263f431f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Train a model</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Set a model version to active</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use the model by monitoring purchase order items</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio392736b885124e309d463bb2263f431f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Plan and deliver materials more reliably</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Avoid production delay and re-scheduling</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Decrease manual effort to monitor and resolve issues earlier</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get up-to-date lead time update for goods or services at master level for direct and indirect procurement</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>采购订单项目的交货日期预测 (3FY)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio392736b885124e309d463bb2263f431f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio392736b885124e309d463bb2263f431f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">生产所需的物料由多个供应商提供。延迟交货会影响工厂的按时生产，并导致装配线重新计划，这成本非常高。间接物料延迟还会导致支持员工提供所需产品或服务的中断。机器学习算法根据多种情况识别供应商延迟，并预测延迟的可能性。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在创建采购订单或采购申请期间，物料主数据中的提前期有时不考虑处理和审批时间。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio392736b885124e309d463bb2263f431f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">训练模型</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将模型版本设置为活动</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过监控采购订单项目使用模型</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio392736b885124e309d463bb2263f431f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">更可靠地计划和交付物料</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">避免生产延迟和重新计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少手动工作，尽早监控和解决问题</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获取主级别货物或服务的最新提前期更新，以进行直接和间接采购</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
